evisit are probably false like the  things that made them who we thought  they were leading into the finale it  does start to feel like you're taking  some risks but I don't think there's  anything wrong with that if you have a  plan that you think you can pull off as  much as I love dark I want to see what  else they can do and I would rather see  creatives air on the side of Taking  Chances there's a chance that it might  not work but you also get a better  reward when it does I wasn't pulled into  this world in the same way I was to win  then but these characters are starting  in a different place it's a different  feeling it's asking a lot of interesting  questions about how we perceive the  world around us how there is so much  that's outside of our control even when  we understand what's going on and how  hard it can be to let go of things even  when you know it's the right thing to do  as a TV show I think it's impressive on  a few different levels the  cinematography Direction and The  intentional writing are things we  already knew they could do and those are  all still there and the performances  came came through when the situation  called for it the emphasis on the puzzle  made it so that some of the characters  didn't have much to do but they all had  some things that they can build on in  future Seasons I thought the score was a  little dialed back compared to dark I  mean that show had so much atmosphere  but I thought that gave it more weight  when it did kick in one thing that I  really liked was the way they went about  revealing things they kept the audience  on the same Pace as the characters and  putting the viewers in a situation where  you pretty much know what's going on but  you just don't want to believe it yet  felt very deliberate and just a great  touch if you're planning on turning  things on their head I do have a lot of  questions so many that I think I'd  rather get into those in a separate  video there are also a lot of details I  want to go back and take a closer look  at so be on the lookout for some more  videos this week we're in the same place  as the main character right now we don't  know how much of what we're experiencing  is real or what to believe I guess not  in in the exact same place because if we  can believe Henry and her turn at  playing God she tried to create a place  where she could do the impossible and  forget there's probably a lot more going  on and I'm looking forward to finding  out and I think that's a great place to  leave things  let me know in the comments what you  thought about the season what was your  favorite episode I think I probably got  hooked in at the end of episode two I  was a little disoriented with things  maybe for the first couple but from  there I was pretty much like okay I want  to figure out what's going on here the  simulation effect is a little bit  strange considering how important every  single detail felt in dark like I said I  don't love this idea I'd be happy to be  proven wrong and I would be impressed if  they looked at this as a challenge they  thought they could tackle and they do  manage to pull it off please like this  video If you enjoyed it please subscribe  to my channel if you haven't already and  thanks for watching I'll talk to you  soon
 

